1
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:19,148
Bonjour, Marinette. Ça va ?
Hello, Marinette. How are you?

2
00:00:19,248 --> 00:00:24,620
Très bien, merci ! On révise le corps ?
Very well, thanks! Shall we review the body?

3
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:30,500
Oui. La tête, les yeux, le nez et la bouche.
Yes. The head, the eyes, the nose, and the mouth.

4
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:35,156
Et l'oreille ? J'ai deux oreilles !
And the ear? I have two ears!

5
00:00:35,256 --> 00:00:40,196
Exactement. Voici ma main et mon bras.
Exactly. Here are my hand and my arm.

6
00:00:40,296 --> 00:00:43,748
Je montre ma jambe et mon pied.
I show my leg and my foot.

7
00:00:43,848 --> 00:00:48,596
Super ! Tu connais bien le corps.
Great! You know the body well.

8
00:00:48,696 --> 00:00:53,564
Merci, Adrien. À bientôt !
Thanks, Adrien. See you soon!
